# State directory for tab-atelier-headless, created by the systemd-tmpfiles
# pacman hook on install. Mirrors the deb postinst's `install -d -m 0750`.
# The unit's StateDirectory= would also create it on first start, but
# pre-creating it lets an admin run the daemon by hand for debugging and keeps
# tabs.json / signing keys in place across restarts.
#Type Path                 Mode UID          GID          Age Argument
d     /var/lib/tab-atelier  0750 tab-atelier  tab-atelier  -   -
